        "en": "Spend an hour talking honestly about what you usually keep silent. Openness without fear or criticism."
      },
      "days": 1,
      "goal": {
        "ua": "Зруйнувати мовчазні бар’єри та зміцнити довіру.",
        "en": "Break silent barriers and build trust."
